    "Albedo values are flat colours; the engine modulates them at runtime (hp, status, elite). Nothing is baked.",
    "Every tower owns one energy hue, spaced 25–60° apart, and its projectile / muzzle / impact inherit it.",
    "Status tints replace the enemy albedo; mark drives emissive. Strongest status per channel wins (Statuses.cs)."
